-inline-element coh-ce-b04c10fc"> <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-4dfcd11e">  <a href="/about"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link coh-ce-9326e10d"  title="For over a century, we’ve been driven by a belief that the world we want tomorrow starts with how we do business today."><span class="menu-item__link-content">All About Mars</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-3734610a" >For over a century, we’ve been driven by a belief that the world we want tomorrow starts with how we do business today.</p>  <button class="coh-button close-submenu-btn coh-ce-5b25ab84 coh-interaction" title="Close submenu menu" data-interaction-modifiers="[{&quot;modifierType&quot;:&quot;add-modifier&quot;,&quot;interactionScope&quot;:&quot;parent&quot;,&quot;interactionTarget&quot;:&quot;.mega-menu-wrapper&quot;,&quot;interactionParent&quot;:&quot;.mega-menu-wrapper&quot;,&quot;modifierName&quot;:&quot;no-hover&quot;}]" data-coh-settings='{ "xs":{"buttonAnimation":[{"animationType":"none"}]},"lg":[] }' type="button"> </button>  <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-2366c165">Overview</div> </div> </div>  <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-28c4917a">  <ul class="coh-menu-list-container coh-unordered-list menu-level-2 coh-ce-33f9e9de"><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/the-five-principles"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c"  title="Our Principles form the foundation of how we do business today and every day."><span class="menu-item__link-content">The Five Principles</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >Our Principles form the foundation of how we do business today and every day.</p> </div></li><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/mars-compass"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c"  title="The Mars Compass serves as a guide to keep us on track and ensures we&#039;re heading in the right direction towards our vision of the world we want tomorrow."><span class="menu-item__link-content">Mars Compass</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >The Mars Compass serves as a guide to keep us on track and ensures we're heading in the right direction towards our vision of the world we want tomorrow.</p> </div></li><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/mars-impact-fund"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c" ><span class="menu-item__link-content">Mars Impact Fund</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >Through the Mars Impact Fund, we invest in long-term partnerships that strengthen communities, advance science and improve the lives of companion animals.</p> </div></li><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/history"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c"  title="For more than five generations, Mars has evolved to create products and services that people (and their pets) love."><span class="menu-item__link-content">Our History</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >For more than five generations, Mars has evolved to create products and services that people (and their pets) love.</p> </div></li><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/leadership"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c"  title="Our global leadership team is responsible for building on our storied history while setting the vision for our path forward."><span class="menu-item__link-content">Leadership Team</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >Our global leadership team is responsible for building on our storied history while setting the vision for our path forward.</p> </div></li><li class="coh-menu-list-item coh-ce-24eebfc1" > <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-7a7f556d">  <a href="/about/inclusion-and-diversity"   data-coh-settings='{  }' class="coh-link menu-item__link-external coh-ce-cf9a4d6c"  title="No matter the visible or invisible differences, we have long-been committed to fostering an environment where everyone has an equal opportunity to reach their full potential."><span class="menu-item__link-content">Inclusion & Diversity</span></a>  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-f48170c9" >No matter the visible or invisible differences, we have long-been committed to fostering an environment where everyone has an equal opportunity to reach their full potential.</p> </div></li></ul>    <div class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-a968202c"> <div class="coh-container mega-menu-sub-nav has-children coh-ce-2845d5e3" >  <div class="coh-block mega-menu-sub-nav-footer coh-ce-a586471a"> <nav role="navigation" aria-labelledby="block-mars-acss-allaboutfooter-menu" id="block-mars-acss-allaboutfooter">
            
